Z||000001||DXR_DAD||08-20-2000||11:57 AM||||Robert seems like everyone has a Pro or Con on this one, so I don't know THE BEST???<BR>I have had the MSD for two years with NO problems AT ALL! Seems like everyone has a different set-ups, different mods, more heat, less heat in the engine compartment this may play a big part?<P>Just my thoughts?<BR>DXR_DAD||||reg||1
